      "message": "ymodew: remove redundant 'otherwise' clause\n\nWe now have two sentences starting with 'otherwise' in short sequence,\nwhich is a bit confusing. If the previous X-permission condition does\nnot hold, then we will not update the m-bit. There is no need to\nexplictly state that, so we can remove the second 'otherwise' clause.",
